OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best
OL,7,     Fclassical music for your morning,
OL,8,     Fwith discoveries and surprises
OL,9,     Frubbing shoulders with familiar
OL,10,     Ffavourites.
OL,11,G1300 Classical Live
OL,12,     FElizabeth Alker showcases the best
OL,13,     Fperformances from the UK and
OL,14,     Fbeyond, including the BBC
OL,15,     FPhilharmonic playing Sibelius's
OL,16,     FKarelia Suite.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Verdi
OL,18,     F4/5. Kate Molleson explores
OL,19,     FVerdi's battles with authority and
OL,20,     Fsocietal expectations.
