OL,5,G1700 In Tune
OL,6,     FClassical guitarist Tohi Harada
OL,7,     Fplays live. Mark Simpson and
OL,8,     FTamara Stefanovich chat to Petroc
OL,9,     Fabout the world premiere of Mark's
OL,10,     Fpiano concerto.
OL,11,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,12,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,13,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,14,     Ffavourites.
OL,15,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,16,     FJerome Kuhn conducts soloists and
OL,17,     Fthe BBC Concert Orchestra in a
OL,18,     Fmythologically themed programme,
OL,19,     Fincluding a semi-staged
OL,20,     Fperformance of David Buckley's
OL,21,     Fone-act opera Oracle.
